WEBVTT

01:40.130 --> 01:43.020
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.130 --> 01:46.039
[Episode 11]

02:03.650 --> 02:04.710
Sister Pei.

02:06.630 --> 02:08.070
Zhao Yuanzhou asked me

02:09.350 --> 02:10.360
to give you

02:10.360 --> 02:12.390
Pei Siheng's puppet.

02:18.430 --> 02:20.160
I don't know what he wants to do.

02:28.070 --> 02:28.990
Sister Pei.

02:30.910 --> 02:33.150
You must want to be alone.

02:35.230 --> 02:36.150
Then I'll

02:36.170 --> 02:37.310
be off.

03:02.290 --> 03:03.080
Sister.

03:03.010 --> 03:05.710
♫If you were a spring night♫

03:05.760 --> 03:08.400
♫I'm the silent mountain♫

03:08.730 --> 03:11.460
♫You're a sad firefly♫

03:11.540 --> 03:14.100
♫Guarding the last moment of the night♫

03:14.380 --> 03:17.090
♫Why don't you remember♫

03:17.160 --> 03:19.840
♫I'm always by your side?♫

03:19.870 --> 03:21.700
♫Like wind surrounding flowers♫

03:21.780 --> 03:24.380
♫Guarding the memories♫

03:23.510 --> 03:24.710
You're still alive.

03:24.590 --> 03:28.230
♫Never fading away♫

03:30.590 --> 03:31.390
Of course not.

03:32.829 --> 03:34.190
I died a long time ago.

03:35.910 --> 03:37.110
You know that.

03:40.150 --> 03:42.520
♫I guard the eaves♫

03:43.060 --> 03:44.990
♫And watch the times fade♫

03:45.840 --> 03:51.200
♫You hold the flame and watch the night♫

03:48.190 --> 03:49.230
Then why are you…

03:51.150 --> 03:53.300
Zhao Yuanzhou used the Chaos Spell

03:51.490 --> 03:53.930
♫I count the winters♫

03:53.870 --> 03:55.550
to keep my soul.

03:54.329 --> 03:56.710
♫And waited for one more year♫

03:56.550 --> 03:58.020
I know a spell

03:57.010 --> 04:02.000
♫My heart is full of passion♫

03:58.070 --> 03:59.800
called Chaotic Impermanence.

04:00.750 --> 04:02.310
It can make your soul

04:02.310 --> 04:04.430
re-form in the puppet.

04:02.660 --> 04:06.410
♫The stars dazzle and the crescent moon curves♫

04:05.550 --> 04:06.940
But since it's chaotic,

04:06.480 --> 04:07.650
♫The guilty greed♫

04:07.590 --> 04:09.070
it's orderless and ever-changing.

04:07.720 --> 04:11.190
♫Thousands of dark hairs, long and short♫

04:10.790 --> 04:12.270
Maybe you won't be able to

04:11.260 --> 04:13.550
♫The cruel entanglement♫

04:13.080 --> 04:15.070
show up in this world ever again.

04:13.920 --> 04:19.279
♫Lend me the cold lamp for one night♫

04:16.519 --> 04:17.660
Or maybe

04:18.370 --> 04:21.350
you can accompany and protect your sister every day and night.

04:19.560 --> 04:24.600
♫Let regret stay before dawn♫

04:23.390 --> 04:24.460
What do you say?

04:24.670 --> 04:27.100
♫Turns out I'm a wanderer♫

04:27.190 --> 04:30.100
♫And you're a song of reluctant parting♫

04:30.140 --> 04:33.120
♫In the sky of floating snowflakes♫

04:33.230 --> 04:35.860
♫You are the only warm bloom♫

04:35.880 --> 04:38.560
♫But why don't I remember♫

04:37.950 --> 04:39.310
I can occasionally…

04:38.600 --> 04:41.280
♫How much the plot has twisted?♫

04:39.750 --> 04:41.720
I can occasionally keep you company now.

04:41.720 --> 04:43.490
♫I forgot the bitter karma♫

04:43.560 --> 04:46.159
♫I missed it again and again♫

04:46.220 --> 04:49.780
♫Helpless♫

04:49.980 --> 04:52.470
♫Turns out I'm a wanderer♫

04:50.710 --> 04:51.670
Heng.

04:52.550 --> 04:55.360
♫And you're a song of reluctant parting♫

04:55.480 --> 04:58.640
♫I'm a black-and-white wound♫

04:55.970 --> 04:57.680
Why are you so silly?

04:58.680 --> 05:01.260
♫You're the vibrant red color♫

04:59.909 --> 05:01.550
I often got sick when I was young.

05:01.290 --> 05:04.080
♫How can I not remember♫

05:03.150 --> 05:04.470
I'd always been a burden for our family…

05:04.150 --> 05:06.780
♫You're always by my side?♫

05:06.840 --> 05:08.690
♫Like wind surrounding flowers♫

05:07.350 --> 05:08.510
and for you.

05:08.510 --> 05:10.840
I never saw you as a burden.

05:08.770 --> 05:16.980
♫Guarding the memories, never fading away♫

05:13.870 --> 05:15.530
It was for myself that I wanted

05:17.310 --> 05:18.870
to be a demon hunter.

05:20.630 --> 05:22.100
It wasn't because of you.

05:23.990 --> 05:26.120
You often got sick when you were young.

05:27.200 --> 05:29.110
The medicine in the mortal world didn't work at all.

05:29.110 --> 05:32.310
But there might be miracles in the Wilderness.

05:34.340 --> 05:36.270
So I worked hard to hunt demons

05:38.030 --> 05:39.790
so that one day

05:41.310 --> 05:43.240
I could find some miraculous medicine

05:43.240 --> 05:44.540
to cure you.

05:48.790 --> 05:50.190
I didn't feel tired.

05:56.070 --> 05:58.260
Because that was my biggest wish.

06:00.510 --> 06:01.310
Sister,

06:02.300 --> 06:03.830
your wish has come true.

06:05.790 --> 06:07.510
I'm very healthy

06:08.470 --> 06:09.510
and strong now.

06:10.430 --> 06:12.240
I won't make you worry anymore.

06:15.430 --> 06:16.830
I can even protect you.

06:24.310 --> 06:25.110
Sister.

06:30.040 --> 06:30.850
Back then…

06:31.870 --> 06:34.200
Back then, I didn't want to become a demon.

06:35.940 --> 06:37.300
I was very scared.

06:39.110 --> 06:39.909
Because

06:41.040 --> 06:42.110
as a demon…

06:45.510 --> 06:47.510
I couldn't be your brother anymore.

06:57.520 --> 06:58.540
Don't be afraid.

07:00.870 --> 07:02.750
If you became a demon again,

07:03.720 --> 07:06.150
I'd become a demon with you.

07:09.330 --> 07:11.560
You finally learned to joke.

07:13.030 --> 07:14.230
Smile more.

07:17.270 --> 07:18.150
That's good.

07:24.950 --> 07:26.020
So, Sister,

07:27.100 --> 07:27.900
look,

07:29.430 --> 07:30.630
no matter what…

07:33.740 --> 07:35.810
this is somewhat of a good ending.

07:38.440 --> 07:39.480
Isn't it?

07:42.990 --> 07:43.790
Sister.

07:44.860 --> 07:45.860
Remember

07:47.320 --> 07:48.230
to smile more.

07:50.500 --> 07:51.920
In the days to come…

07:55.460 --> 07:56.590
don't cry again.

09:06.630 --> 09:07.690
You can't sleep?

09:21.410 --> 09:22.680
Are you guys

09:22.990 --> 09:24.450
going to Kunlun tomorrow?

09:24.860 --> 09:25.430
Yeah.

09:26.950 --> 09:27.750
That's great.

09:29.150 --> 09:29.990
How about you?

09:30.670 --> 09:31.930
Are you coming with us?

09:34.190 --> 09:34.990
Me?

09:36.100 --> 09:37.900
I'll pass.

09:38.690 --> 09:41.650
Those at the Demon Hunting Bureau need me to cook for them.

09:41.650 --> 09:42.980
They all like me so much.

09:47.710 --> 09:50.260
You'd rather stay in the mortal world as a cook

09:50.490 --> 09:52.020
than return to the Wilderness

09:52.020 --> 09:53.280
to be the Mountain God?

09:55.090 --> 09:55.890
Yes.

09:58.040 --> 09:59.200
I don't understand.

09:59.750 --> 10:01.280
The mortal world is so good.

10:02.410 --> 10:03.410
There are all kinds of

10:03.410 --> 10:04.610
amazing things here.

10:05.730 --> 10:06.990
But Grandpa and the others

10:06.990 --> 10:09.120
are willing to stay in the Wilderness,

10:09.960 --> 10:11.560
a desolate and lonely place,

10:12.380 --> 10:13.910
till the end of their lives.

10:15.350 --> 10:17.330
I see no point

10:18.390 --> 10:20.050
in spending my life like that.

10:20.460 --> 10:23.010
There are many ways to live your life.

10:24.630 --> 10:26.540
Responsibility is a choice,

10:27.440 --> 10:28.690
not a constraint.

10:30.340 --> 10:32.470
Neither shouldering responsibility

10:32.480 --> 10:34.600
nor pursuing dreams is wrong.

10:35.320 --> 10:36.290
Some people

10:36.640 --> 10:39.180
only wish to be a quiet lake in the forest,

10:40.270 --> 10:41.400
while other people

10:42.190 --> 10:44.470
want to become a running river.

10:46.270 --> 10:47.270
Lady Goddess,

10:47.390 --> 10:48.250
what about you?

10:50.190 --> 10:51.350
What's your choice?

10:54.430 --> 10:55.950
Master said

10:56.730 --> 10:59.460
it's not the Baize Token that made us the Goddess

11:00.710 --> 11:03.510
but the determination to protect the Wilderness.

11:04.020 --> 11:06.020
I want peace between the two worlds.

11:07.080 --> 11:09.010
Because in the Wilderness

11:10.160 --> 11:12.960
and the mortal world, there are people and demons…

11:15.100 --> 11:16.030
that I care for.

11:19.900 --> 11:21.550
Come with us to Kunlun.

11:23.630 --> 11:26.380
Jiu is waiting for you to cook for him.

11:35.480 --> 11:38.080
The plan is going more smoothly than I thought.

11:38.220 --> 11:39.490
How about a toast?

11:46.360 --> 11:48.020
The way you look at me

11:49.000 --> 11:50.880
makes me very uncomfortable.

12:12.750 --> 12:14.660
The plan is going smoothly,

12:15.960 --> 12:18.280
but you'd better stay committed.

12:19.090 --> 12:21.700
Look at who I am.

12:22.830 --> 12:24.520
Don't get smart.

12:25.570 --> 12:27.150
Relax.

12:27.460 --> 12:29.610
We have the same goal.

12:30.140 --> 12:32.910
I believe we can get the Baize Token very soon.

12:33.630 --> 12:35.340
Aren't you happy?

12:37.830 --> 12:38.710
Getting it

12:39.370 --> 12:40.770
can't make me happy.

12:43.890 --> 12:45.460
But destroying it

12:47.430 --> 12:49.390
is very delightful.

12:52.630 --> 12:54.150
Five days later,

12:54.830 --> 12:56.590
there will be a blood moon.

12:57.680 --> 13:00.850
That's the best time to destroy the Baize Token.

13:02.800 --> 13:04.630
So those from the Demon Hunting Bureau

13:04.630 --> 13:06.230
can't get to Kunlun too soon.

13:08.360 --> 13:10.040
Do something about it.

13:10.710 --> 13:11.630
Don't worry.

13:13.940 --> 13:17.080
Qing Geng is already waiting at the foot of Mount Kunlun.

13:20.070 --> 13:21.650
But don't forget

13:21.860 --> 13:23.740
what you promised me.

13:25.140 --> 13:27.180
Zhao Yuanzhou's inner core,

13:27.820 --> 13:29.550
I'll definitely get it for you.

13:32.010 --> 13:34.380
What about your promise to me?

13:37.880 --> 13:39.510
Can you fulfill it?

13:43.280 --> 13:45.140
I don't need to fulfill it myself.

13:45.380 --> 13:47.380
Someone else will fulfill it for me.

13:47.710 --> 13:49.990
And she can do better than me.

14:16.330 --> 14:18.350
Stall them at Sinan Water Town.

14:19.580 --> 14:20.680
Can you do it?

14:22.930 --> 14:23.890
I'll try my best.

14:28.510 --> 14:32.760
[Lingxi Villa]

14:39.440 --> 14:40.890
To be obsessed

14:41.710 --> 14:43.320
is to be trapped.

14:44.940 --> 14:46.930
Life is full of ups and downs.

14:47.480 --> 14:49.400
It's just all about obsession

14:49.880 --> 14:51.270
and karma.

14:59.350 --> 15:00.150
Wen Xiao.

15:00.590 --> 15:01.900
What are you writing?

15:02.400 --> 15:03.940
Cheng Huang was obsessed

15:04.270 --> 15:06.600
with keeping the Goddess alive.

15:07.590 --> 15:09.060
He was so obsessed

15:09.080 --> 15:10.910
that he swam against the tide

15:11.610 --> 15:13.420
and eventually hurt himself.

15:15.200 --> 15:16.620
Obsessions

15:17.770 --> 15:19.330
trap not only mortals

15:20.720 --> 15:22.420
but also immortals.

15:25.780 --> 15:26.830
I'm so happy!

15:26.830 --> 15:28.130
We're going to Mount Kunlun.

15:28.130 --> 15:28.870
Let me tell you.

15:28.870 --> 15:30.290
I've packed a lot of things in my box.

15:30.290 --> 15:31.290
It's very heavy.

15:35.220 --> 15:36.060
Brother Zhuo.

15:36.080 --> 15:37.710
My box is so heavy.

15:38.620 --> 15:39.590
Give it to me if you're tired.

15:39.590 --> 15:40.790
I can carry it for you.

15:41.130 --> 15:42.990
I told you I could carry it for you.

15:45.480 --> 15:47.060
Thank you, Brother Zhuo.

15:47.400 --> 15:49.220
I'm stronger than Zhuo.

15:53.520 --> 15:56.780
Someone stronger is coming, in terms of malicious energy.

15:58.640 --> 15:59.320
Morning.

16:00.340 --> 16:01.180
Friends.

16:03.260 --> 16:04.840
Everyone is here, Yinglei.

16:05.010 --> 16:06.610
Lend us your incense burner.

16:07.620 --> 16:09.050
Just Mount Kunlun.

16:09.080 --> 16:09.870
No problem.

16:10.490 --> 16:11.300
My turf.

16:22.350 --> 16:23.260
This...

16:24.680 --> 16:26.220
This is Mount Kunlun?

16:30.850 --> 16:33.040
Well… sorry.

16:33.090 --> 16:35.330
When I was thinking about Mount Kunlun just now,

16:35.330 --> 16:36.150
I suddenly thought that

16:36.150 --> 16:37.090
Ms. Pei once mentioned

16:37.090 --> 16:39.400
Sinan Water Town at the foot of Mount Kunlun

16:39.400 --> 16:41.090
which had an interesting Lantern Festival.

16:41.090 --> 16:42.530
And I got distracted.

16:44.480 --> 16:47.130
Sinan Water Town is at the foot of Mount Kunlun.

16:47.150 --> 16:49.210
I came here for investigation once.

16:49.400 --> 16:51.150
It happened to be during the Lantern Festival,

16:51.150 --> 16:53.280
so I casually mentioned it to Jiu.

16:53.670 --> 16:55.040
Why did you eavesdrop?

16:56.840 --> 16:57.780
It's fine.

16:58.310 --> 16:58.970
Mount Kunlun is not far away.

16:58.970 --> 17:00.120
We just need to hike a bit.

17:00.120 --> 17:00.910
Hike?

17:01.030 --> 17:02.760
Hiking is good for your health.

17:07.099 --> 17:08.170
Sinan Water Town

17:08.190 --> 17:09.390
is a beautiful place.

17:09.410 --> 17:11.079
People here live in peace.

17:11.190 --> 17:13.900
It's a wealthy paradise.

17:15.839 --> 17:17.089
But this place

17:18.079 --> 17:19.660
doesn't look like it.

17:19.910 --> 17:20.790
Looks like

17:22.430 --> 17:24.180
many people have died.

17:36.430 --> 17:38.680
They've arrived at Sinan Water Town.

17:43.200 --> 17:45.850
Then we can kill him soon.

17:51.070 --> 17:53.290
The plague has spread across the town.

17:54.160 --> 17:56.540
This red string can make you immune to it.

17:57.020 --> 17:57.970
Otherwise,

17:57.990 --> 17:59.320
you'll be infected too.

18:21.240 --> 18:23.080
When I came here for a case,

18:23.490 --> 18:25.490
things were completely different.

18:25.800 --> 18:27.330
It's been just a few months.

18:27.360 --> 18:29.080
What on earth has happened?

18:32.400 --> 18:33.760
This place is so scary.

18:33.930 --> 18:35.350
It's like a haunted town.

18:36.780 --> 18:37.670
Don't be afraid.

18:37.670 --> 18:38.880
With me by your side,

18:38.880 --> 18:39.550
you…

18:44.160 --> 18:44.870
Jiu.

18:44.940 --> 18:46.200
With you holding me like this,

18:46.200 --> 18:47.560
how can I use my sword?

18:47.580 --> 18:49.420
But I'm really scared.

18:49.640 --> 18:50.980
I'll hold this instead.

18:52.540 --> 18:54.290
Don't pull my hair.

18:55.670 --> 18:56.270
Here.

18:57.000 --> 18:58.050
Hold this.

19:03.840 --> 19:06.420
What has ruined this wealthy town

19:06.700 --> 19:07.900
is either war

19:08.110 --> 19:09.070
or plague.

19:16.100 --> 19:18.700
I made these detoxification pills myself.

19:19.750 --> 19:21.210
You each take one.

19:21.480 --> 19:23.940
Try not to come in contact with the residents

19:24.030 --> 19:24.940
or animals here.

19:24.940 --> 19:26.680
Stay away from dead bodies.

19:39.670 --> 19:41.330
How did it happen so suddenly?

19:41.460 --> 19:43.690
The news never reached Tiandu.

19:44.280 --> 19:47.080
No one knows this town is in such a grave situation.

19:48.830 --> 19:50.870
Let's split up to make inquiries.

19:53.640 --> 19:54.810
Be careful.

20:00.770 --> 20:01.680
Come back!

20:01.750 --> 20:02.910
Brother Zhuo!

20:02.910 --> 20:04.710
Brother Zhuo!

20:11.970 --> 20:14.370
Before we find out the source of the plague,

20:14.670 --> 20:16.310
we have to isolate this place

20:16.930 --> 20:19.660
to prevent the plague and miasma from spreading.

20:19.910 --> 20:22.170
Zhao Yuanzhou, lend me your Baize Token.

20:22.960 --> 20:24.290
You want to hold my hand?

20:26.150 --> 20:27.400
No problem.

20:54.230 --> 20:56.000
Now, to you, is he

20:56.520 --> 20:59.250
the cruel demon who killed your father or brother

20:59.870 --> 21:01.930
or a friend who fights alongside you?

21:04.590 --> 21:05.540
Both.

21:08.270 --> 21:09.610
But it doesn't matter.

21:11.130 --> 21:12.230
No matter what,

21:12.230 --> 21:13.510
I'll kill him myself.

21:15.070 --> 21:17.490
But he has half of the Baize Token now.

21:17.900 --> 21:19.130
I can't kill him.

21:21.750 --> 21:23.110
Is that the real reason?

21:28.090 --> 21:29.620
After we reach Mount Kunlun

21:30.230 --> 21:32.690
and find a way to merge the two halves of the Baize Token,

21:32.690 --> 21:33.790
Wen Xiao can get back

21:33.790 --> 21:35.630
the power of Baize Goddess.

21:36.620 --> 21:37.510
By then,

21:38.690 --> 21:40.950
I'll settle all my grudges with him.

21:44.670 --> 21:45.670
I didn't expect

21:45.670 --> 21:48.330
to find the other half of the Baize Token so soon.

21:48.990 --> 21:51.250
And it happened to be with Zhao Yuanzhou.

21:52.430 --> 21:54.690
It seems that the universe

21:54.730 --> 21:56.390
is protecting the Wilderness

21:56.580 --> 21:57.850
and the mortal world.

22:00.530 --> 22:01.540
I don't think so.

22:04.270 --> 22:05.200
What do you mean?

22:07.790 --> 22:09.520
I don't think it's accidental.

22:10.330 --> 22:11.730
It's more like by design.

22:14.120 --> 22:16.430
Pei Siheng's puppet suddenly appeared,

22:16.780 --> 22:19.550
leading us to investigate the case of Cheng Huang

22:20.070 --> 22:22.520
and learn the truth about the Baize Token.

22:22.650 --> 22:24.200
Your brother's appearance

22:24.220 --> 22:26.260
is too much of a coincidence.

22:29.800 --> 22:31.250
You suspect my brother?

22:32.410 --> 22:34.470
I just suspect Cheng Huang's motive.

22:35.250 --> 22:38.030
Pei Siheng has always been under Cheng Huang's control,

22:38.030 --> 22:40.270
but Cheng Huang is leading us to catch him.

22:40.270 --> 22:41.930
Don't you think it's strange?

22:42.870 --> 22:44.040
I have the feeling

22:45.070 --> 22:46.740
that we're like puppets

22:47.150 --> 22:48.720
that are manipulated

22:48.810 --> 22:51.130
by a pair of invisible hands.

22:53.230 --> 22:55.350
We got what we wanted too easily.

22:56.260 --> 22:58.460
Everything has been going so smoothly.

23:00.530 --> 23:01.810
This feeling

23:02.820 --> 23:04.740
unsettles me very much.

23:08.960 --> 23:09.760
Well…

23:11.960 --> 23:13.890
I'll go check the perimeter again.

23:15.700 --> 23:17.300
I can do it alone.

24:18.120 --> 24:19.530
Why are we in a drug shop?

24:19.810 --> 24:22.410
I want to see if they have enough herbs in stock.

24:25.220 --> 24:26.060
Master?

24:30.350 --> 24:31.150
Jiu?

24:32.160 --> 24:33.790
Master, it's really you.

24:34.940 --> 24:36.270
What are you doing here?

24:36.640 --> 24:37.670
Hello, sir.

24:37.690 --> 24:38.410
I'm…

24:38.860 --> 24:39.960
good friend.

24:41.940 --> 24:42.930
Master.

24:43.310 --> 24:44.840
Shouldn't you be in Tiandu?

24:44.850 --> 24:45.980
Why are you here?

24:46.470 --> 24:47.590
I was told that

24:47.590 --> 24:49.720
a plague broke out in Sinan Water Town,

24:49.840 --> 24:51.100
so I came to have a look.

24:51.540 --> 24:52.750
But I didn't expect it

24:53.720 --> 24:55.110
to be so serious.

24:56.570 --> 24:58.220
It started five days ago.

24:59.370 --> 25:02.100
Local physicians couldn't do anything about it.

25:02.410 --> 25:04.670
Some people were too scared and ran away.

25:05.250 --> 25:06.220
Ran away?

25:06.400 --> 25:09.000
Wouldn't they bring the plague to other towns?

25:09.190 --> 25:10.970
Life here was always peaceful.

25:11.010 --> 25:13.300
With the protection of the spiritual energy of Mount Kunlun,

25:13.300 --> 25:15.800
this town never saw any plague or natural disaster.

25:15.800 --> 25:16.950
The only plague I know

25:16.950 --> 25:18.870
happened hundreds of years ago.

25:18.890 --> 25:20.940
It's said to have been horrible,

25:20.960 --> 25:23.910
and almost everyone in the town died.

25:24.710 --> 25:25.950
I wonder how it'll end

25:25.970 --> 25:26.950
this time.

25:27.730 --> 25:28.720
Master.

25:28.920 --> 25:30.910
Can't you do anything about it either?

25:30.910 --> 25:32.480
To end this plague,

25:32.500 --> 25:34.290
we need to find the source.

25:34.650 --> 25:36.700
There are four causes for plague: unnatural energy,

25:36.700 --> 25:37.800
imbalance in the seasons,

25:37.800 --> 25:39.060
lingering fog and dew,

25:39.060 --> 25:41.060
and the build-up of harmful miasma.

25:41.300 --> 25:43.630
I've checked them one by one.

25:44.330 --> 25:46.590
None of them are the cause of this plague.

25:47.700 --> 25:48.990
None of them are?

25:49.320 --> 25:50.920
Then what could be the cause?

25:51.090 --> 25:52.070
Could it be that

25:52.100 --> 25:53.630
there's a demon in the town?

25:54.200 --> 25:55.320
Demon…

25:55.630 --> 25:56.770
Don't be afraid.

25:56.790 --> 25:58.120
With me protecting you,

25:58.120 --> 25:59.040
no demon

25:59.070 --> 26:00.430
or poison…

26:00.810 --> 26:02.450
Brother Zhuo!

26:02.510 --> 26:03.650
Brother Zhuo…

26:04.010 --> 26:04.790
Jiu!

26:05.350 --> 26:05.970
What's wrong?

26:05.970 --> 26:06.770
Brother Zhuo.

26:06.840 --> 26:07.800
Come with me.

26:07.820 --> 26:09.440
We were talking about you just now.

26:09.440 --> 26:10.810
Let me introduce you.

26:11.830 --> 26:12.880
This

26:13.130 --> 26:14.450
is my master,

26:14.790 --> 26:16.590
the best physician in Tiandu.

26:16.720 --> 26:18.130
I'm Wen Zongyu.

26:18.430 --> 26:19.950
Nice to meet you, Mr. Zhuo.

26:22.290 --> 26:24.730
No wonder Jiu is a medical prodigy.

26:24.780 --> 26:26.910
It turns out that he trained under you.

26:27.600 --> 26:28.930
What have you found out?

26:30.830 --> 26:33.630
Zhao Yuanzhou and Wen Xiao have found the source of the plague.

26:33.630 --> 26:34.820
Some demon

26:34.860 --> 26:36.520
has been messing around here.

26:36.900 --> 26:37.830
Demon?

26:38.590 --> 26:39.740
Demon.

26:40.120 --> 26:42.250
If it's a demon that caused the plague,

26:42.360 --> 26:45.090
my medical skills can't be of any help.

26:47.340 --> 26:48.180
Mr. Zhuo,

26:48.990 --> 26:50.950
please save the people here.

26:53.800 --> 26:54.590
Oh, right.

26:56.440 --> 26:57.930
Could you please

26:57.950 --> 26:59.950
take this token of the Demon Hunting Bureau

26:59.950 --> 27:02.910
to borrow soldiers from the nearby government offices?

27:02.910 --> 27:04.140
We need to lock down the town

27:04.140 --> 27:05.440
and cut off all access

27:05.460 --> 27:07.460
to prevent the spread of the plague.

27:12.840 --> 27:14.120
[Demon Hunting Bureau]

27:14.720 --> 27:15.960
Lives are at stake.

27:18.050 --> 27:19.630
I'll definitely make it.

27:22.100 --> 27:22.910
Jiu.

27:23.270 --> 27:24.150
Be careful,

27:24.150 --> 27:24.950
okay?

27:25.870 --> 27:26.930
I'll go then.

27:26.970 --> 27:27.760
Okay.

27:28.150 --> 27:29.630
Sir, don't worry.

27:29.630 --> 27:30.110
Shut up!

27:30.110 --> 27:31.370
I'll keep Bai Jiu safe.

27:42.160 --> 27:43.040
Do you see it?

27:50.320 --> 27:51.400
Yes.

27:54.570 --> 27:56.660
Red malicious energy is everywhere.

28:00.210 --> 28:02.740
Indeed, this plague is caused by a demon.

28:04.990 --> 28:06.840
The red malicious energy

28:07.470 --> 28:08.510
is from me.

28:11.620 --> 28:13.310
See if there's anything else.

28:13.920 --> 28:14.490
Okay.

28:22.470 --> 28:24.280
In red malicious energy,

28:24.640 --> 28:27.040
there are strands of black demonic energy.

28:27.630 --> 28:28.650
That's right.

28:29.160 --> 28:30.420
Can you see the source?

28:37.000 --> 28:37.930
It's over there.

28:42.640 --> 28:44.420
[Lingxi Villa]

28:52.050 --> 28:53.890
Mr. Situ, you're absent-minded

28:53.920 --> 28:55.170
and about to lose.

28:55.680 --> 28:57.680
Don't be a sore loser later.

28:57.920 --> 28:58.810
Mr. Fan,

28:59.240 --> 29:00.790
are you really not worried?

29:01.460 --> 29:02.670
How can you focus on the game

29:02.670 --> 29:05.130
when you're worrying about something else?

29:05.690 --> 29:06.690
I'm leaving.

29:07.280 --> 29:09.530
I'll play chess with you another day.

29:16.990 --> 29:17.800
Come.

29:21.670 --> 29:22.790
Send this letter

29:22.820 --> 29:23.740
to Mr. Zhuo immediately.

29:23.740 --> 29:24.270
Yes.

29:30.130 --> 29:33.330
[Glorious Flowers in Spring and Solid Fruits in Autumn]

30:10.080 --> 30:11.750
Just normal joss paper.

30:11.990 --> 30:14.850
Mr. Zhuo, why have you drawn your Cloud Light Sword?

30:17.480 --> 30:19.340
You've opened your umbrella too.

30:43.910 --> 30:44.790
Jiu!

30:44.930 --> 30:45.720
Zhuo!

31:31.110 --> 31:32.240
Brother Zhuo!

31:35.200 --> 31:35.970
Jiu!

31:40.720 --> 31:41.150
Jiu!

31:41.150 --> 31:41.710
Wait.

31:41.750 --> 31:42.700
Wait for what?

31:42.750 --> 31:44.200
For Jiu to be eaten by the demon?

31:44.200 --> 31:45.860
Don't you think it's strange?

31:46.300 --> 31:47.650
It's obvious that the demon took Jiu

31:47.650 --> 31:49.510
to lure us over.

31:50.030 --> 31:52.320
Mr. Zhuo and Zhao Yuanzhou have gone into the fog.

31:52.320 --> 31:53.550
They're so capable.

31:53.570 --> 31:55.200
They can definitely save Jiu.

31:55.200 --> 31:56.940
We'll only distract them if we follow.

31:56.940 --> 31:58.670
Let's just wait here

31:58.750 --> 31:59.950
for them to come back.

32:00.410 --> 32:01.570
I'll protect you.

32:14.450 --> 32:15.610
Brother Zhuo!

33:00.500 --> 33:02.720
[Good Virtues Shine Forever]

33:03.980 --> 33:04.730
[Carry on the Legacy]

33:20.630 --> 33:24.110
[A Magnificent Story]

33:22.830 --> 33:23.700
Who are you?

33:24.680 --> 33:26.070
Where's Jiu?

35:13.860 --> 35:14.710
Wake up.

35:19.570 --> 35:20.830
Where's Brother Zhuo?

35:22.460 --> 35:23.480
Jiu!

35:24.050 --> 35:25.070
Jiu.

35:25.480 --> 35:26.270
Are you okay?

35:26.360 --> 35:27.420
Are you hurt?

35:28.230 --> 35:29.490
Where's Brother Zhuo?

35:29.890 --> 35:31.700
I saw Zhuo running in here

35:32.070 --> 35:33.560
and followed him into the yard.

35:33.560 --> 35:34.850
Before I could find Zhuo,

35:34.850 --> 35:36.200
I saw Jiu.

35:58.320 --> 35:59.460
Where is Zhuo?

36:01.750 --> 36:02.650
It seems that

36:02.860 --> 36:04.680
their target is not Jiu

36:05.280 --> 36:06.430
but Mr. Zhuo.

36:06.460 --> 36:08.660
People don't disappear out of thin air.

36:24.440 --> 36:26.300
It's the blood of the Bingyi Clan.

36:27.240 --> 36:29.010
Mr. Zhuo must have been hurt.

36:35.450 --> 36:36.380
Open the coffin.

37:02.410 --> 37:03.960
The Cloud Light Sword

37:04.550 --> 37:06.570
is indeed worthy of its reputation.

37:07.720 --> 37:10.520
In ancient times, the Bingyi Clan killed Ying Long

37:11.050 --> 37:12.970
and used its horns

37:14.010 --> 37:15.190
and soul

37:15.190 --> 37:16.940
to make two Cloud Light Swords.

37:17.710 --> 37:20.360
They can kill all demons in the world.

37:20.560 --> 37:22.160
Of course they're powerful.

37:22.710 --> 37:26.570
Only the descendants of the Bingyi Clan can use the Cloud Light Sword.

37:26.590 --> 37:28.460
If you want to kill Zhao Yuanzhou…

37:31.680 --> 37:33.150
you have to rely on him.

37:44.010 --> 37:48.030
[Carry on the Legacy]

37:58.000 --> 37:59.070
Red string?

38:00.610 --> 38:02.270
This body has a red string too.

38:07.980 --> 38:09.240
This body also has one.

38:20.870 --> 38:21.990
What can you smell?

38:24.470 --> 38:25.380
Nothing.

38:25.400 --> 38:26.150
Just weird.

38:26.830 --> 38:27.700
Tsk,

38:27.720 --> 38:29.650
we should've brought a dog with us.

38:33.440 --> 38:34.390
You're being

38:34.410 --> 38:36.090
very rude to the Mountain God!

38:36.120 --> 38:37.290
Pointing your finger at me

38:37.290 --> 38:38.090
is even ruder.

38:38.120 --> 38:38.740
You're rude.

38:38.740 --> 38:40.000
You're rude.

38:43.450 --> 38:44.430
Great Demon.

38:46.110 --> 38:47.740
What are you doing?

38:47.770 --> 38:50.370
I want to experience the feeling of lying dead.

38:50.620 --> 38:51.360
Wen Xiao.

38:51.390 --> 38:52.720
Do you want to have a try?

38:53.160 --> 38:55.240
Bring Jiu with you.

38:55.870 --> 38:57.150
Zhuo bled.

38:57.150 --> 38:58.860
You'll definitely get hurt too.

38:58.860 --> 39:00.670
It's safer to bring

39:00.670 --> 39:01.860
a physician with you.

39:01.860 --> 39:03.060
Xiao.

39:03.470 --> 39:04.470
He

39:04.800 --> 39:05.800
is a bad influence

39:07.190 --> 39:08.110
on you.

39:09.120 --> 39:10.040
No.

39:10.080 --> 39:10.970
I refuse.

39:11.030 --> 39:12.620
I feel insecure when I'm with him.

39:12.620 --> 39:13.420
You can't refuse.

39:13.420 --> 39:14.420
I'll protect you.

39:45.430 --> 39:47.330
Zhao Yuanzhou is really smart.

39:47.770 --> 39:49.770
Something is wrong with the coffin.

39:49.930 --> 39:50.590
Wait.

39:51.080 --> 39:52.220
Why is it wet here?

40:45.560 --> 40:47.160
You're actually awake?

41:43.460 --> 41:44.570
Who on earth

41:44.800 --> 41:45.840
are you?

41:47.320 --> 41:48.280
Qing Geng.

41:50.310 --> 41:51.110
A demon?

41:53.220 --> 41:54.010
A demon.

41:56.470 --> 41:57.710
However,

41:58.300 --> 42:00.030
without the Cloud Light Sword,

42:00.500 --> 42:02.500
the famous Zhuo Yichen

42:02.520 --> 42:04.580
can only be under the thumb of a demon.

42:06.710 --> 42:08.970
I didn't expect you to be so bold

42:09.270 --> 42:10.730
as to pretend to be in a coma

42:10.750 --> 42:12.880
and throw yourself into danger alone.

42:13.480 --> 42:15.980
You're indeed a descendant of the Bingyi Clan.

42:15.980 --> 42:18.240
If I hadn't pretended to be unconscious,

42:18.500 --> 42:20.130
how could I have found out

42:20.250 --> 42:21.940
your secret plot?

42:22.340 --> 42:24.300
Once Zhao Yuanzhou is dead,

42:24.480 --> 42:26.060
I can get his inner core

42:26.700 --> 42:28.690
and finish my unfinished business.

42:28.690 --> 42:30.690
Then I'll give his inner core to you.

42:32.760 --> 42:35.260
You want Zhao Yuanzhou's inner core

42:35.930 --> 42:37.870
but can't kill him.

42:38.930 --> 42:39.810
So,

42:40.150 --> 42:42.000
you need me to do it.

42:43.400 --> 42:44.840
To be precise,

42:45.370 --> 42:47.030
I need your sword.

42:47.750 --> 42:49.400
Only the Cloud Light Sword

42:49.430 --> 42:51.450
can kill Zhao Yuanzhou

42:52.250 --> 42:53.910
and help me get his inner core.

42:55.910 --> 42:58.350
Who brought me here?

42:58.830 --> 43:00.360
You don't need to know that.

43:00.710 --> 43:01.630
If you don't

43:01.970 --> 43:04.370
tell me who is behind this

43:05.350 --> 43:06.790
and what they want,

43:08.190 --> 43:11.480
I'll never help you kill Zhao Yuanzhou.

43:15.360 --> 43:16.230
Interesting.

43:17.200 --> 43:19.350
He killed your father and brother,

43:19.460 --> 43:20.720
yet you really see him as a friend

43:20.720 --> 43:22.230
who fights alongside you?

43:23.850 --> 43:25.120
I'll kill him,

43:26.950 --> 43:29.010
but it has nothing to do with you guys.

43:32.240 --> 43:34.990
Mortals are really hard to understand.

43:35.950 --> 43:38.150
I'm kindly helping you to take revenge,

43:38.190 --> 43:39.790
but you don't appreciate it.

43:50.310 --> 43:53.320
This was originally a spine from the fierce beast Qin Yuan in the Wilderness.

43:53.320 --> 43:55.040
Surprisingly, it's been made

43:55.110 --> 43:56.970
into a needle in the mortal world.

43:58.370 --> 44:00.970
They all say demons are cold-blooded and evil.

44:01.720 --> 44:04.120
But humans are worse.

44:05.530 --> 44:07.910
It's said that if one is jabbed by it,

44:08.210 --> 44:10.210
they'll suffer greatly

44:11.350 --> 44:13.030
and wish they were dead.

44:22.680 --> 44:25.510
The Cloud Light Sword can actually feel your pain.

44:26.280 --> 44:27.350
Are you afraid?

44:48.680 --> 44:49.390
Are you

44:49.660 --> 44:50.810
afraid?

44:55.010 --> 44:56.390
I only

44:56.620 --> 44:58.870
follow my heart.

44:59.150 --> 45:01.410
I don't take orders from anyone.

45:03.870 --> 45:06.020
People say humans are greedy,

45:06.060 --> 45:07.020
cowardly,

45:07.090 --> 45:08.060
and selfish.

45:09.170 --> 45:11.500
They stop at nothing to get what they want.

45:12.090 --> 45:12.890
Are you

45:13.130 --> 45:14.430
any different?

45:17.640 --> 45:19.740
Try me.

45:21.130 --> 45:22.210
Sure.

45:22.920 --> 45:25.260
Mr. Zhuo, since you're so stubborn…

45:29.310 --> 45:30.780
how about now?

45:38.530 --> 45:40.680
Kill Zhao Yuanzhou for me.

45:41.450 --> 45:42.740
Let's do it together.

45:45.890 --> 45:47.840
You'll help me,

45:48.200 --> 45:49.190
won't you?

45:53.550 --> 45:54.540
Say

45:55.040 --> 45:56.410
you will.

45:57.110 --> 45:58.350
I

45:59.130 --> 46:00.160
will.
